    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d16">

                <pb facs="0128" n="8" xml:id="pg8"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The King of Belgium to President
                    Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-02"><hi rendition="#italic">July 2,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am very much grieved at the death of Mr. Hay, and wish to express to you, Mr.
                    President, my sincere condolences, and to assure you of my keen sympathy with
                    you in your bereavement and that of the American people.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Leopold.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
